From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Saturn <saturn@localhost>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 12:22:53 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] Saturn: sidebar phase 2 - favorites grid, Clear, New tab
 row

While the sidebar is expanded, pinned tabs form a 3-column favorites grid
(46px tiles, white 5%, no outline). A divider with Clear (closes today's
unpinned tabs; opens a fresh tab first if nothing is pinned) and the New tab
row sit between the grid and today's tabs. Collapsed, the stock rail and +
button are unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
